{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-031",
    "title": "天门初鸣"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_171",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "“记忆里的人不会再离开，人间的人不会再保持原样。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "第三盏灯点亮后，回川城只剩一夜。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5445,
          "end": 5445
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "城中所有姓名牌同时变成空白，街上的人却没有立刻消失。他们仍能走、能说话、能认出自己的屋子，只是每当有人叫出一个名字，声音便会被钟楼的青光吞掉。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5447,
          "end": 5447
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临站在塔顶，手里的无名小灯没有点燃。第一盏、第二盏和第三盏灯围着他缓慢旋转，灯火交错，像三条互相纠缠的锁链。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5449,
          "end": 5449
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你们准备怎么做？”慧闻问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5463,
          "end": 5463
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“让人离开。”陆照临说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5465,
          "end": 5465
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“离开城，记忆会在路上崩散。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5467,
          "end": 5467
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“留在城里呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5469,
          "end": 5469
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“成为封天令的锚。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5471,
          "end": 5471
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“总要有选择。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5473,
          "end": 5473
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻把无相铜镜递给他：“镜子可以把一段记忆留在城外，但只能留一段。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5475,
          "end": 5475
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“留谁的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5477,
          "end": 5477
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“由你决定。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5479,
          "end": 5479
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "钟楼下传来争吵。一个老人抱着孩子，指着顾长离喊：“她拿走了我的名字！”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5481,
          "end": 5481
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离没有辩解，只把铜针递回老人手里：“我没有拿。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5483,
          "end": 5483
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那为什么我记不得自己是谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5485,
          "end": 5485
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为有人替你做了选择。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5487,
          "end": 5487
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老人抬头看钟楼：“那你们为什么不把名字还回来？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5489,
          "end": 5489
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离看向陆照临：“因为还不回去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5491,
          "end": 5491
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临把无相铜镜贴在钟楼石栏上。镜面浮出一条条名字，有的完整，有的只剩姓氏。最下方出现一个熟悉的名字：陆沉舟。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5493,
          "end": 5493
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他在城心。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5495,
          "end": 5495
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你确定？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5497,
          "end": 5497
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“镜子只照记忆，不照时间。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5499,
          "end": 5499
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可它一直在照他。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5501,
          "end": 5501
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为你一直在记他。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5503,
          "end": 5503
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第三盏灯的火焰忽然向外爆开，城中一半房屋的门同时打开。失名的人走出屋子，朝钟楼缓慢聚拢。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5505,
          "end": 5505
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜在东门大喊：“玄霄宗开始攻城！”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5507,
          "end": 5507
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "剑光穿过夜色，落在城墙上。灰袍修士带着十余名弟子进入城门，白玉令牌上浮出封天令的三方印记。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5509,
          "end": 5509
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆照临，封天令即将失效。”他喊，“交还残印，玄霄宗会保存回川城居民的记忆。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5511,
          "end": 5511
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“保存在哪里？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5513,
          "end": 5513
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“宗门的记忆库。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5515,
          "end": 5515
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁能保证他们拿得回来？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5517,
          "end": 5517
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士沉默了一瞬：“宗门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5519,
          "end": 5519
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜冷笑：“又是宗门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5521,
          "end": 5521
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士挥剑，弟子们结成阵势。剑光所过，居民纷纷倒地，身体没有受伤，眼神却变得茫然。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5523,
          "end": 5523
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离冲到街心，铜针连出，击偏三道剑气。她肩上的债契黑纹已经爬到耳后，名字正在从她的记忆里剥落。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5525,
          "end": 5525
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾长离！”陆照临喊。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5527,
          "end": 5527
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她回头：“我还记得。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5529,
          "end": 5529
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记得什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5531,
          "end": 5531
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你叫陆照临。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5533,
          "end": 5533
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“还有呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5535,
          "end": 5535
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你父亲叫陆沉舟。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5537,
          "end": 5537
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她的声音越来越低：“我叔父……叫顾——”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5539,
          "end": 5539
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "后面的字没有说出来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5541,
          "end": 5541
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临从塔顶跃下，掌心残印与两枚石片同时发亮。青光凝成一道屏障，将城心和街道分开。玄霄宗剑阵撞上屏障，整座城的地面随之震动。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5543,
          "end": 5543
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "金色裂纹在陆照临气海中再次扩大。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5545,
          "end": 5545
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第二道劫雷的余威尚未散尽，第三道雷云已在城上聚拢。陆照临听见太虚遗脉的声音：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5547,
          "end": 5547
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“借火者，先还一名。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5549,
          "end": 5549
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我还谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5551,
          "end": 5551
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“最先被你忘记的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5553,
          "end": 5553
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临脑中浮出一张模糊的脸。那不是父亲，也不是母亲，而是北河城一个卖灯油的老人。他曾在陆照临七岁时送过他一根灯芯。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5555,
          "end": 5555
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临想不起老人的名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5557,
          "end": 5557
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不。”他说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5559,
          "end": 5559
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "青光屏障立刻裂开。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5561,
          "end": 5561
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离冲到他身边：“不能拒绝？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5563,
          "end": 5563
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我不替它选。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5565,
          "end": 5565
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就自己选。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5567,
          "end": 5567
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“拿我的名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5571,
          "end": 5571
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临猛然看她：“你会被彻底抹掉。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-065",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5573,
          "end": 5573
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灯在。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-103",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5649,
          "end": 5649
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临在街巷中继续查访，先听老人讲旧事，再听孩子说眼前的变化。他把每一份证词写下，却不急着判断真假。有人认为灯应由宗门掌管，有人认为城里每个人都有守灯的资格，也有人只想让家人平安回家。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-104",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5651,
          "end": 5651
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "留给后人。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-105",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5653,
          "end": 5653
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "它没有门扇，也没有门框，天空裂缝向两侧缓慢拉开，露出一片没有星辰的黑暗。黑暗中漂浮着无数灯火，每一盏灯下都站着一个模糊的人影。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5663,
          "end": 5663
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它在召回被删去的人。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5665,
          "end": 5665
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“召回之后呢？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5667,
          "end": 5667
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“回到记忆里，或者回到人间。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5669,
          "end": 5669
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“有什么区别？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5671,
          "end": 5671
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记忆里的人不会再离开，人间的人不会再保持原样。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5673,
          "end": 5673
        }
      }
    ],
